   "sourceHash": "eac09b31e8d6760c9839907d5490941c3fb913eadf0c59ecbbd81afacfb33d93",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]ホーム[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]すべてのプログラム[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]睡眠回復療法[[CLOSE_5]]",
